# Sunrise Gen AI — August 2026 lock

Supersedes the December 2024 lock. Srikanth Bellary authorized this on 25 August 2026. That lock (Orbitron-everywhere, neon `#00F5FF` / `#FF6B35`, all-caps tracking, no heading text, LabelSaber/Swaram/Lensort, “Cutting-Edge AI Solutions,” logo-as-hero) **is the college look. Do not revert.**

## Host

- Keep Next `output: 'export'`, `trailingSlash`, unoptimized images, existing GitHub Pages workflow.
- No Vercel. No backend. No paid CDN. No new huge video.
- Self-host OFL/SIL fonts in `public/fonts`.
- GSAP + Lenis are in the project. Use them. Extra client-only libraries only if static export still builds.

## Hero — no video

- **DELETE / never restore** the MacArthur causeway clip. No video hero, no poster fallback, no background video.
- Hero is original WebGL (fullscreen quad, no three.js): atmospheric sunrise + living topographic/intelligence field.
- Architectural — light, type, space. Not a game: no particles, spaceship, synthwave grid, bouncy orbs, HUD, circuit wallpaper, Lottie, glow soup.
- First 10 seconds must shock from craft. `prefers-reduced-motion` gets a still frame.

## Type and color

- Body/UI: Geist at 16–18px, leading ~1.5. Display headings **cap at 40–56px desktop**, smaller on phone. **Orbitron is not the body font.**
- No viewport-filling words. No billboard nouns. No L-corner frames. No `01 —` chapter chrome.
- Work is a dense grid/rows — three offers visible at once, not pinned one-word posters.
- Optional one Instrument Serif italic line at body size. Never set paragraphs in a display/sci-fi mono.
- Colors: void `#000818`, sun `#D9661C`, hot `#FAC345`, teal `#06B6C3`. Body text is warm paper `#E8E2D6`.
- Header is title-only and modest. Wordmark as the name.

## Content

- Sunrise Gen AI LLC, Wellington, FL only. No Hyderabad.
- `sbellary@sunrisegenai.com` and `440-340-8383`. No gmail on the page.
- One POV: production systems for operations and messy knowledge; we ship the tools we use.
- Two or three consulting offers in plain English. No seven tiles. No `01 —` chapter chrome.
- Homepage product: OpenStinger only. No Ingre / Ingredient Scanner / LabelSaber / Swaram / Lensort / Job Book.
- Films as a horizontal craft reel, not a business unit.
- No fake case studies, invented logos, or parked domains.
- “Up to 60%…” may stay as a quiet line, not a badge.

## Motion

- Hero WebGL is the prowess. Film reel may pin horizontally. Do **not** pin work as one-noun billboards.
- Custom cursor only if quiet (no bounce). Sparse type is not craft. Tasteful empty lookbook = fail.
